            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this model does not shoot in the Shooting phase, all shooting attacks made by other models in his unit gain the Ignores Cover special rule until the end of the current phase. This cannot be used when firing Overwatch, but can be used at the same time as a Command and Control Node.</characteristic>
