      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Tidewall Field" id="c0e6-c5d1-b46d-4926" hidden="false">
          <description>Roll a dice each time a successful cover save is made for a model within 1&quot; of a Tidewall Shieldline&apos;s energy barrier, so long as the barrier is between the attacker and the target. On a roll of 6 the attacking unit suffers 1 Randomly Allocated Wound or glancing hit, resolved at the same AP as the attacking weapon.</description>
