                <rule name="XV02 Pilot Battlesuit" id="94f1-5d70-5155-923d" hidden="false">
                  <description>The XV02 Pilot Battlesuit incorporates a Blacksun Filter. Longstrike&apos;s TX7 Hammerhead can fire Overwatch and has the Supporting Fire special rule. Furthermore, Longstrike&apos;s TX7 Hammerhead is not limited to firing Overwatch once each phase (it can still only fire Overwatch once against each eligible charging unit).</description>
