            <rule name="Haywire Burst" id="718b-cd95-4e0a-4e66" hidden="false">
              <description>For each successful hit this weapon inflicts on a vehicle, roll for a single Haywire hit as well as resolving the attack from the weapon&apos;s profile.</description>
