        <rule name="Supreme Loyalty" id="011e-f4d8-226e-f308" hidden="false">
          <description>While Aun&apos;Va is alive, all friendly units with the Tau Empire Faction on the battlefield re-roll failed Fear, Morale, Pinning and Regroup tests.</description>
