              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whenever Aun&apos;Va&apos;s unit suffers one or more unsaved Wounds from a shooting attack, roll a D6. If the result is equal to or higher than the AP of the shot, the Wound is discounted, exactly as if a cover save had been passed (Wounds from AP1 weapons are therefore automatically discounted). This roll cannot be made against weapons with AP-.</characteristic>
