              <description>Can disembark at any point during the Sun Shark&apos;s move (even though models cannot normally disembark from Zooming Flyers). Note that, unlike other Transports, a Sun Shark Bomber that moves before its Interceptor Drones disembark can continue its move immediately after they have disembarked.</description>
